00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:05.900
Reo.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:10.490
What the hell do you think 
you're doing to Mabu?!

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.910
That's... me?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.620
Otter...

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.530
I am an otter.

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:19.670
But I'm also you.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.420
What do you mean by that?

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:25.950
We otters exist in this world as concepts.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:30.050
I am a mirror of the desires inside of you.

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:31.810
Stop!

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:36.310
You're the one who wants to own Mabu, Reo.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:41.190
You wanted to lock lips 
with this hollow machine.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.560
Stop...

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:48.190
You're merely being made to dance 
by your desires—by us otters.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:52.200
Now, Mabu, what matters the most to you?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.700
Him?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.660
Or me?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.710
How do I look to you?

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:04.710
Right now, I need you.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.700
<b>No beginning</b>

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:13.470
<b>No connection</b>

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:13.470
<b>No end</b>

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.380
I knew you were an imposter.

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:14.100
I was an idiot for believing you,
 even for a moment.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:18.580
I'm going to take back the real 
Mabu with my own strength.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.090
Just one more...

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.480
I just need one more Dish of Hope.

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:28.610
Kazu-chan?

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.110
Hope

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.240
Sorry, did I wake you up?

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:37.240
Are you going somewhere, Kazu-chan?

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.790
Yeah.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.500
Kinda.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:43.250
Are you leaving without telling me again?

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.260
I'm not that clueless anymore.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:48.820
You're right.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.070
Sorry.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.970
I'm about to go help Enta.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.410
Is it dangerous?

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.330
It could be.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.620
But I've made up my mind.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.390
This time, it's my turn to help him.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:07.480
Enta-niichan always helped me, too.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.900
He was with me every week during rehab, too.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:15.280
I guess a lot happened that 
I didn't know about, huh?

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:20.660
Enta-niichan and I had the same wish.

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:31.250
Isn't that awesome?

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.860
<b>Kazu-chan</b>

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.010
<b>I'm rooting
for you,
too!</b>

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.010
<b>by Enta</b>

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.270
Is this me?

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:37.390
You're going to run again, aren't you?

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:43.270
You used to like this 
player before, remember?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.270
<b>"Kaisou"</b>

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.270
<b>O Flashback</b>

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.270
<b>X Seaweed</b>

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.410
<i>That's right, I did!</i>

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:57.320
I love it when you're running.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.110
I'll be waiting.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:03.340
I'll be back.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.960
You only live once.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.110
You don't get extra lives.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.470
When things aren't working out,
 just throw it all away.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:17.890
Nii-san!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.730
Yo, I was worried.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:25.820
Are you all right?

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:26.960
Yeah.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.360
Why do you have that gun?

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:34.360
I swapped it out before you 
threw it out four years ago.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.450
Not bad.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.120
That's my kid brother for you.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:45.330
Are you going to throw me, 
your kid brother, out, too?

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:49.690
I don't care if you're a 
bad person to the core.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.960
You're my brother, no matter what.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:00.720
You're a little too good to be my brother.

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:05.230
The bad ones are the ones 
who survive in this world.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.980
<b>I   W a n t   t o   C o n n e c t ,</b>

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.980
<b>b u t   I   C a n ' t   E x p r e s s   I t</b>

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.050
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:18.050
<i>Please</i>

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:23.620
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:28.970
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:34.250
<i>I want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.680
<i>The flickering lightbulb that's been neglected</i>

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.680
<i>One morning, it had quietly died</i>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.430
<i>It's almost like you and me</i>

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:48.180
<i>Like the fleeting moment when
we held our hands together</i>

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:53.810
<i>I sat with my arms around my knees</i>

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:57.400
<i>Thinking of the days long gone</i>

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.970
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:03.030
<i>Please</i>

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:08.260
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:13.870
<i>Even if you aren't here now</i>

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:19.540
<i>Please give me the courage to reach out</i>

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.420
<i>Stand by you</i>

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:25.550
<i>Please</i>

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:30.750
<i>I want to get rid of everything</i>

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:35.900
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:43.030
<i>I just want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.420
I did it!

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:01.670
Damn it...

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:09.680
What are you doing?

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.190
You need to get to a hospital.

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.190
Forget it.

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.690
It won't matter.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:21.220
Nii-san!

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:39.580
I had everything planned to work out.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:40.960
Stop talking already.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.470
You ruined everything...

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:45.970
I'm sorry.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:46.960
So please...

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:50.490
Keep yourself fed with this.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:54.710
Son of a bitch...

00:20:56.010 --> 00:21:02.740
It's such a pain in the ass,
trying to connect...

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:42.850
Fuck!

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:55.250
<b>This is a work of fiction.
